## What the coral atolls' people say and are called (AtollTheme.life, read through LifePools.of): a stilt town over a
## lagoon. Pearl divers, fishers, canoe-wrights and copra cutters who live on the water and walk the sandbars at low
## tide, who read the reef's colour for the weather and swear the lagoon remembers everyone who ever swam it.
